<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Anxious to sample some traditional Spanish=
 culture while taking in a La Liga match years ago, Football Daily and some=
 friends decamped to Gran Alicant. As we prepared to leave a quaint bodega =
(the Dick Turpin), where we=E2=80=99d been sampling the local hooch (Guinne=
ss), to travel to the nearby stadium, an elderly local resident with an unm=
istakable mackem accent informed us that the Elche home game to which we we=
re heading was not being played until the following evening. It had fallen =
victim to Spanish TV=E2=80=99s infuriating habit of rescheduling random top=
-flight matches with little or no notice or consideration for Johnny-come-l=
atelys who might have travelled from afar to watch them. We never did get t=
o see Elche play in the flesh but did get to watch the current La Liga base=
ment-dwellers give Jos=C3=A9 Mourinho an almighty fright on TV on Tuesday n=
ight, as they went <em>this</em> close to snatching a point from Real Madri=
d.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Allowed to spend 14 times more on players =
and coaching staff than their hosts at the Estadio Mart=C3=ADnez Valero und=
er La Liga rules, it was no surprise to see Real Madrid go 2-0 up as they a=
ppeared to be cruising towards a routine rout of their lowly opposition. Ho=
wever, a succession of missed chances (hello, Vin=C3=ADcius J=C3=BAnior) fo=
llowed by second-half sucker punches from Abiel Osorio and Fer Ni=C3=B1o me=
ant Mourinho was sweating as Elche approached the final seven minutes on th=
e front foot, looking for an unlikely winner. Sadly, there was no fairytale=
 and Carlos Esp=C3=AD popped up with a late, late winner to break Elche hea=
rts and dig his side out of one of several holes they have already found th=
emselves in this season. While a balmy Tuesday night in Elche may not be th=
e most glamorous of environments, not for the first, second, third, fourth =
or even 534th time in their history, Madrid found a way.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CThree points and nothing more,=E2=
=80=9D harrumphed Mourinho in his post-match interview. =E2=80=9CThe proble=
m seems obvious to me. It=E2=80=99s harder to know why but it=E2=80=99s eas=
ier to understand that there are matches that seem over but in the end, are=
n=E2=80=99t. Matches where we have three, four, five chances to finish them=
 but don=E2=80=99t. After failing to do so, it feels like we go from ease t=
o losing control. With the changes I made in the end, I took all the risks.=
 We won but I could have lost.=E2=80=9D Modest to a T, as ever, Mourinho wi=
ll be hoping for a better performance from his team when they make the shor=
t trip to the Wanda Metropolitano to face their city rivals Atl=C3=A9tico o=
n Sunday (or Saturday, depending on the whims of broadcasters) before the i=
nternational break.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">While the out-of-sorts Vin=C3=ADcius Jr di=
d little on Tuesday night beyond convince Arsenal fans they may have dodged=
 a very expensive summer bullet, he was one of three Madrid stars who refus=
ed to show off T-shirts showing solidarity with the people of Ceuta that we=
re handed to both sets of players as they made their way out on to the pitc=
h before kick-off. Along with Kylian Mbapp=C3=A9 and Ibrahima Konat=C3=A9, =
Vin=C3=ADcius Jr chose not to show the slogan =E2=80=9CTodos somos caballas=
=E2=80=9D (=E2=80=9CWe are all mackerels=E2=80=9D), in support of the Spani=
sh exclave which was overwhelmed by the arrival of 80,000 migrants, mostly =
from Morocco, in recent months. Subsequently lambasted in some quarters for=
 being too supportive of the migrants and not supportive enough of the citi=
zens of Ceuta, it was an awkward situation where the Madrid players were pu=
t on the spot and simply couldn=E2=80=99t do right for doing wrong.</p>
